From: lij768423-svg <lij768423@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:54:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: cool missing-thinking accounts and list them in quality
 guard

First no-thinking withhold puts the account on a 24h scheduling
cooldown without disabling it. A later miss after that cooldown
expires disables the account. Quality-guard degrade-accounts now
includes quality_degraded retries as missing_thinking so operators
can see the rotated accounts.
